    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/95e669e585b1ff70777a29ed3e7550b0.avif?t=1752499721\" data-has-big width=800 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mumagi: Stellar Saviors </i></strong>is a co-op horde survivor where you can gather up to 4 players to take down celestial forces. Choose a magical girl, enhance your powers, and restore time and space to their natural order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/59d45a05ef2c059805ea427701082659.avif?t=1752499721\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat hordes of enemies, level up, and upgrade your magical girl. Choose powers that fit your unique playstyle, and take advantage of your magical girl's signature move. When you add friends to the mix, your ability to work together will determine if you win or lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/46e35b2f414cec7a15860c5f4c613eb2.poster.avif?t=1752499721\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/46e35b2f414cec7a15860c5f4c613eb2.webm?t=1752499721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/46e35b2f414cec7a15860c5f4c613eb2.mp4?t=1752499721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial beings have warped time and space in order to create a universe under their control! However, their meddling has backfired against them: magical girls from various timelines and universes have suddenly found themselves gathered together. With their combined power, they may just be enough to take down the celestial beings and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play together in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique magical girls with their own powers and stories</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/95e669e585b1ff70777a29ed3e7550b0.avif?t=1752499721\" data-has-big width=800 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mumagi: Stellar Saviors </i></strong>is a co-op horde survivor where you can gather up to 4 players to take down celestial forces. Choose a magical girl, enhance your powers, and restore time and space to their natural order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/59d45a05ef2c059805ea427701082659.avif?t=1752499721\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat hordes of enemies, level up, and upgrade your magical girl. Choose powers that fit your unique playstyle, and take advantage of your magical girl's signature move. When you add friends to the mix, your ability to work together will determine if you win or lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/46e35b2f414cec7a15860c5f4c613eb2.poster.avif?t=1752499721\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/46e35b2f414cec7a15860c5f4c613eb2.webm?t=1752499721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689240/extras/46e35b2f414cec7a15860c5f4c613eb2.mp4?t=1752499721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestial beings have warped time and space in order to create a universe under their control! However, their meddling has backfired against them: magical girls from various timelines and universes have suddenly found themselves gathered together. With their combined power, they may just be enough to take down the celestial beings and restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play together in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique magical girls with their own powers and stories</p></li></ul>",
